{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And Moses.</b> Scripture mentions their years, and in all of Scripture we do not find prophets of whom Scripture records that they prophesied in old age except these, because their rank is greater than all the prophets, and to them alone HaShem spoke in the pillar of cloud. And do not suppose that Samuel is among them, because it is written, \"He will speak to them in a pillar of cloud\" — for I have already explained in its place that the Torah was given to these alone, and through them the righteous will inherit the world to come, and all the prophets are prophets of reproof or of things to come."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:18.464073588Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}